#ASSERT `Art 40(1) the general-purpose AI model is presumed to be in conformity with the obligation set out in Chapter V, Sections 2 and 3` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(1) the general-purpose AI model is presumed to be in conformity with the obligation set out in Chapter V, Sections 2 and 3` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 40(2) and (3): the Commission and the participants`

-- Before, on and after the date (all the same shape: JUST TRUE once the group applies, NOTHING before).
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering all requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering all requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering all requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Limb (b), "as applicable": the Commission's judgment is the input.
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering obligations set out in Chapter V, Sections 2 and 3` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering obligations set out in Chapter V, Sections 2 and 3` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must issue standardisation requests covering obligations set out in Chapter V, Sections 2 and 3` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the standardisation request must also ask for deliverables on reporting and documentation processes` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the standardisation request must also ask for deliverables on reporting and documentation processes` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "When preparing a standardisation request" (ruling of 2026-11-05, (c): "when" counts as "where").
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must consult the Board and relevant stakeholders` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must consult the Board and relevant stakeholders` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must consult the Board and relevant stakeholders` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must specify that standards have to be clear and consistent` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must specify that standards have to be clear and consistent` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must specify that standards have to be clear and consistent` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request the European standardisation organisations to provide evidence of their best efforts` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request the European standardisation organisations to provide evidence of their best efforts` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(3) the participants in the standardisation process must seek to promote investment and innovation in AI` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(3) the participants in the standardisation process must seek to promote investment and innovation in AI` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `Article 40(2) fourth subparagraph: inserted by the Omnibus (version as amended only)`

-- Each side of 27 July 2026: the version in force changes (as enacted before, as amended from the day), but Section 5 applies only from
-- 2 August 2026, so the dispatcher answers NOTHING on both (the as-enacted branch is dead: PLAN.md section 5).
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS `as enacted`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS `as amended`
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The text as amended, through its own function (rule 1 of the keel's pattern (a): the as-enacted branch is dead, so the text is tested directly).
#ASSERT `Art 40(2) as amended the Commission must request standardisation deliverables to facilitate joint compliance and presumption of conformity` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 40: the regulative rules`

-- Each rule: nothing is owed before 2 August 2026 (FULFILLED); from then the party must do the act. No time limit and no consequence in the text:
-- a trace that performs the act reads FULFILLED; no trace can show a breach (NOTES.md, "Rules with no breach path (P5)").
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to issue standardisation requests` (Date 1 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to issue standardisation requests` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) issue standardisation requests` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to ask for deliverables on reporting and documentation processes` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) ask for deliverables on reporting and documentation processes` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to consult the Board and relevant stakeholders` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) consult the Board and relevant stakeholders` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to specify that standards have to be clear and consistent` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) specify that standards have to be clear and consistent` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to request evidence of best efforts` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) request evidence of best efforts` AT 5
-- Fourth subparagraph: as enacted nothing is owed (the subparagraph is not in the text); as amended, the duty; and not before 2 August 2026.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to request standardisation deliverables` (Date 1 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(2) the Commission's duty to request standardisation deliverables` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 the Commission` DOES `Art 40(2) request standardisation deliverables` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 40(3) the duty of the participants in the standardisation process` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 40 a participant in the standardisation process` DOES `Art 40(3) seek to promote investment and innovation in AI` AT 5

§ `Article 41(1): when the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications`

-- args: date asked, request made, (i) not accepted, (ii) not delivered in time, (iii) insufficient on fundamental rights, (iv) not complying, no reference published, none expected
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Each of the four alternatives alone, with the request and both limbs of (b): JUST TRUE.
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None of (i) to (iv): the "where" condition fails, JUST FALSE (fork F-41-1).
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No request made.
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A reference has been published (limb (b) first part fails).
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A reference is expected within a reasonable period (limb (b) second part fails).
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission may adopt implementing acts establishing common specifications` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission must consult the advisory forum` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission must consult the advisory forum` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 41(1) the Commission must consult the advisory forum` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 41(2) the Commission must inform the committee that it considers the conditions to be fulfilled` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 41(2) the Commission must inform the committee that it considers the conditions to be fulfilled` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 41(2) the Commission must inform the committee that it considers the conditions to be fulfilled` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

