§ `Seam S14: the helper, and Article 2(2) for a high-risk AI system with Section B products`

-- The helper asks the keel's `Art 2(2) ...` function and says TRUE only where the keel answers JUST FALSE (the provision is not among Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112).
-- args: date asked, route, the products are covered by the legislation listed in Section B of Annex I, the Section B requirements have been integrated, Article number, paragraph
-- Route Article 6(1) with Section B products, from 2 February 2025 (when Chapter I applies): Article 43 is not on the list.
#ASSERT `Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 2 2025) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 43 3
-- The integration fact changes nothing for Article 43: only Articles 57 to 59 depend on it.
#ASSERT `Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 43 3
-- Before 2 February 2025 the keel does not speak, so the provision is not cut.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 2 2025) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 43 3)
-- Route Article 6(2) with Annex III: Article 2(2) is about Article 6(1) systems, so the provision is not cut.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` TRUE FALSE 43 3)
-- Route Article 6(1) but no Section B products: not cut.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` FALSE FALSE 43 3)
-- Article 47 (the whole Article) is not on the list.
#ASSERT `Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 47 0
-- Articles 102 to 112 are on the list: the keel says JUST TRUE, so the helper does not cut.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 102 0)
-- Article 57 applies only in so far as the requirements have been integrated (the keel answers on that fact): not integrated, so cut.
#ASSERT `Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 57 0
-- Article 57 with the requirements integrated: not cut.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 57 0)

